! jboselsla at Philcon 2006, Nov 17-19: Schedule of Events.

This schedule is tentative and in progress. We still don't know the Philcon schedule. Suggestions are welcome.

!! Friday, November 17, 2006
*6:00 - 6:30 p.m. Lojbanic software development- priorities and direction
*6:45 - 7:15 p.m. Do Lojbanists tend to have certain interests in common a lot, and if so why? 
*7:30 - 8:30 p.m. ((Nanofictionary))
*8:45 - 9:15 p.m. Record ourselves for jbocradi podcast
*9:30 - 10:00 p.m. Design brainstorming for ((samxarmuj))

!! Saturday, November 18, 2006
*11:00 p.m. ((la cibyska)), the Lojbanic word-building card game based on TriVirsity
*12:00 p.m. Meet to go to lunch
*1:00 p.m. Lojban ((Lingo)) game
*2:00 - 2:30 p.m. An interview with Lojbab and Laurence Schoen. Logical Language Group meets Klingon Language Institute. The Logical Language and the Warrior Language, together for the first time!
*2:30 - 3:00 p.m. Lojban class by Mark Shoulson.
*3:10 - 3:45 p.m. Lojban class by Mark Shoulson continues after a ten-minute break
*4:00 - 4:30 p.m. Lojbanic software development- priorities and direction, part two
*4:45 p.m. Meet to go to dinner
*6:00 - 6:30 p.m. Skit: "Whose Lisri Is It Anyway?"
*6:45 - 7:15 p.m. Planning for Lojbanimation and film
*7:30 - 8:00 p.m. Record ourselves for jbocradi podcast
*8:15 - 8:45 p.m. How to stir up local interest in Lojban
*9:00 - 10:00 p.m. Choose ((Nanofictionary)), ((la cibyska)), or ((Lingo)) to play again

!! Sunday, November 19, 2006
*sleeping in
*checking out of rooms
*speaking Lojban
*saying goodbyes

